        "sourceMarkdown": "# Day 2, Week 2\n\n## Day Metadata\n- Level: K3\n- Unit Number: 1\n- Unit Theme: A Day on the Farm\n- Day: 2\n- Week: 2\n- Day Type: Power Up\n- Power Up Lesson: PU L6\n- Lesson Role: Language practice 2 and Mission Stage 2\n\n## Circle Time\n### Topic\nTBD (Power Up theme: A Day on the Farm)\n\n### Song\nTBD\n\n### Teacher Notes\nUse Circle Time to warm up the lesson theme. Keep it oral, visual, and routine-based. Model any target sentence as a whole chunk the children can repeat.\n\n## CLIL Class\n### Lesson Outcome\nwill be able to use the present simple for routines with times (o'clock).\n\n### Source\n- Teacher's Book: TB p11\n- Pupil's Book: PB p11\n- Activity Book: AB p11\n- Pupil's Book Audio:\n  - Track 1.16: `u01/PU_SB_BE_L2_U01_Pg011_tr_016(1.16).mp3`\n  - Track 1.17: `u01/PU_SB_BE_L2_U01_Pg011_tr_017(1.17).mp3`\n\n### New Keywords\n- finish\n- go home\n- go to bed\n\n### Recycled Keywords\n- daily routines\n- at school\n- do homework\n- go to school\n- have lunch\n- lesson\n- start\n- present simple questions and answers\n\n### Target Sentences\n- What time do you get up?\n- I get up at seven o'clock.\n- What time does school finish?\n- It finishes at four o'clock.\n\n### Activities and Games\n1. TBD\n2. TBD\n3. TBD\n\n### Teacher / Design Guidance\n**Mission (Power Up — adapt for classroom flow)**\n\nL6: Mission Stage 2: Draw your daily routine\n\nLearners continue developing their daily routine chart with additional language from the unit. They add more activities and practice describing them.\n\n**Power Up teaching focus**\n\nThe original Power Up lesson is the source of truth for this day. The current page shows the auto-classified keywords and target sentences; the teacher can model them as words and as sentence chunks without inventing new content.\n\n## Phonics\n### Content\nTBD\n\n### Teacher Notes\nTBD\n\n## Story\n### Book / Story\nTBD\n\n### Teacher Notes\nTBD\n\n## Review Issues\n### Needs Extension\n- None for this day.\n\n### Source Issues\n- None for this day.\n",
